<tr><td><?= t('Partitioner per dygn','Daily partitions') ?></td><td class="<?= $lst['pi']?'okt':'badt' ?>"><?= $lst['pi']?count($lst['pi']['parts']).' '.t('st','pcs'):t('Nej – kör den senaste SQL-filen (Uppdatera-fliken) så blir tabellen partitionerad. Tills dess raderas gamla rader i omgångar, vilket är långsammare.','No – run the latest SQL file (Update tab) to partition the table. Until then old rows are deleted in batches, which is slower.') ?></td></tr></table>
<p class="mut"><?= t('Tips för stora volymer (MariaDB/MySQL, i serverns konfiguration): sätt innodb_buffer_pool_size till så mycket minne du kan avvara, innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=2 ger snabbare skrivning (men du kan förlora den sista sekunden vid strömavbrott) och lägg databasen på snabb disk. Höj även net.core.rmem_max (till exempel 16777216) så att mottagaren kan ha en stor mottagningsbuffert och inte tappar rader vid toppar.','Tips for large volumes (MariaDB/MySQL, in the server configuration): set innodb_buffer_pool_size to as much memory as you can spare, innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=2 gives faster writes (but you may lose the last second on a power failure) and put the database on fast disk. Also raise net.core.rmem_max (for example 16777216) so the receiver can use a large receive buffer and does not lose lines during bursts.') ?></p><?php endif; ?>
<h3><?= t('Peka enheterna mot VM Monitor','Point the devices at VM Monitor') ?></h3>
<p class="mut"><?= t('Ange serverns IP-adress (nu ','Enter the server’s IP address (now ') ?><code><?= h($rh) ?></code><?= t(') och portarna ovan på enheten. VM Monitor kopplar händelserna till en enhet via avsändarens IP-adress mot adressen du angav under Servrar/Nätverk/…, via värdnamnet i syslog-raden, eller via en koppling du gör manuellt under Syslog (eller Historik → Trap) (för enheter som skickar från en annan IP-adress än den du övervakar).',') and the ports above on the device. VM Monitor links events to a device by the sender’s IP address against the address you entered under Servers/Network/…, by the host name in the syslog line, or by a link you make manually under Syslog (or History → Trap) (for devices that send from another IP address than the one you monitor).') ?></p>
<ul class="mut">
<li><b>UniFi</b>: <?= t('Skicka syslog från Network-appen (Cloud Key, gateway, switchar och accesspunkter) till ','Send syslog from the Network application (Cloud Key, gateway, switches and access points) to ') ?><code><?= h($rh) ?>:<?= $sp ?></code>. <?= t('Menyn heter olika i olika versioner – leta efter Remote Logging, Activity Logging eller SIEM under Settings (Control Plane / System). UniFi skickar normalt syslog, inte SNMP-traps.','The menu has different names in different versions – look for Remote Logging, Activity Logging or SIEM under Settings (Control Plane / System). UniFi normally sends syslog, not SNMP traps.') ?></li>
<li><b>Meraki</b>: <?= t('Network-wide → General → Reporting → Syslog servers: lägg till ','Network-wide → General → Reporting → Syslog servers: add ') ?><code><?= h($rh) ?></code> <?= t('och port ','and port ') ?><code><?= $sp ?></code>, <?= t('välj roller (Event log, Security events, Air Marshal …). Undvik "Flows" om du inte behöver dem, eller filtrera bort dem med listan ovan. Meraki skickar syslog, inte SNMP-traps.','pick roles (Event log, Security events, Air Marshal …). Avoid "Flows" unless you need them, or filter them out with the list above. Meraki sends syslog, not SNMP traps.') ?></li>
<li><b><?= t('Switchar, routrar, brandväggar','Switches, routers, firewalls') ?></b>: <?= t('Ange trap-mottagare ','Set the trap receiver to ') ?><code><?= h($rh) ?>:<?= $tp ?></code> <?= t('med din community (v2c) eller SNMPv3-användare, och syslog-server ','with your community (v2c) or SNMPv3 user, and the syslog server ') ?><code><?= h($rh) ?>:<?= $sp ?></code>. <?= t('Cisco/HP/Aruba: snmp-server host … traps, logging host …; pfSense/OPNsense: Status → System Logs → Settings → Remote Logging; Mikrotik: /system logging action.','Cisco/HP/Aruba: snmp-server host … traps, logging host …; pfSense/OPNsense: Status → System Logs → Settings → Remote Logging; MikroTik: /system logging action.') ?></li>
<li><b>Fortinet / Palo Alto / Sophos / Cisco ASA</b>: <?= t('Fortinet: config log syslogd setting (format default, server och port). Palo Alto: Device → Server Profiles → Syslog (format BSD eller IETF, TRAFFIC-loggar via Log Forwarding). Sophos XG/SFOS: Logging → Syslog servers (format Standard/Default). Cisco ASA: logging host inside … och logging trap informational (meddelande 302013, 106023 och 106100 tolkas). Skicka gärna över TCP.','Fortinet: config log syslogd setting (default format, server and port). Palo Alto: Device → Server Profiles → Syslog (BSD or IETF format, TRAFFIC logs via Log Forwarding). Sophos XG/SFOS: Logging → Syslog servers (Standard/Default format). Cisco ASA: logging host inside … and logging trap informational (messages 302013, 106023 and 106100 are parsed). TCP is recommended.') ?></li>
<li><b>Linux</b>: <code>*.* @<?= h($rh) ?>:<?= $sp ?></code> <?= t('i /etc/rsyslog.d/vmmon.conf, därefter ','in /etc/rsyslog.d/vmmon.conf, then ') ?><code>sudo systemctl restart rsyslog</code>.</li></ul>
<p class="mut"><?= t('Händelserna visas under Syslog (syslog) och Historik → Trap (traps), och under Larmregler kan du skapa regeln "Trap/syslog-händelse matchar". Traps går över UDP, syslog över UDP och/eller TCP (inte TLS).','The events are shown under Syslog (syslog) and History → Trap (traps), and under Alert rules you can create the rule "Trap/syslog event matches". Traps use UDP; syslog works over UDP and/or TCP (no TLS).') ?></p>
<?php elseif($v==='mibs'): $mf=[]; $mn=0; $mq=trim((string)($_GET['q']??'')); $mr=[]; try{ $mf=db()->query('SELECT id,module,fname,n,uploaded FROM mib_files ORDER BY module')->fetchAll(); $mn=(int)db()->query('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mib_names')->fetchColumn();
  if($mq!==''){ if(preg_match('/^\.?\d+(\.\d+)*$/',$mq)){ $o=ltrim($mq,'.'); $st=db()->prepare('SELECT * FROM mib_names WHERE oid=? OR oid LIKE ? ORDER BY oid LIMIT 100'); $st->execute([$o,$o.'.%']); } else { $st=db()->prepare('SELECT * FROM mib_names WHERE name LIKE ? ORDER BY name LIMIT 100'); $st->execute(['%'.addcslashes($mq,'%_\\').'%']); } $mr=$st->fetchAll(); } }catch(Throwable $e){ echo '<p class="card badt">'.t('Tabellerna för MIB saknas – kör senaste SQL-filen under Uppdatera.','The MIB tables are missing – run the latest SQL file on the Update tab.').'</p>'; }
  $have=[]; foreach($mf as $x) $have[$x['module']]=1; $miss=[]; $std=['SNMPv2-SMI','SNMPv2-TC','SNMPv2-CONF','SNMPv2-MIB','RFC1155-SMI','RFC-1212','RFC-1215','RFC1065-SMI','RFC1213-MIB','RFC-1213','RFC1315-MIB'];
